BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5048d7ff-2358-3cec-b3ea-0b82687eb3c9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
